+const serverGuideUpdates={"welcome": ["歡迎來到酒館。可種葡萄、跳踩榨汁、釀酒、調酒，並擺放酒瓶、酒杯、吧檯椅和彩燈。\n普通書＋酒館空瓶→酒館指南；指南＋紙→酒館配方書。搜尋酒名可查看配方與各品質效果。\n指南與廚房各自獨立；酒杯、酒瓶和雪克杯支援森羅廚房餐桌。", "Grow grapes, press juice, brew wine, mix cocktails and decorate with bottles, cups, stools and string lights. Book + Tavern empty bottle makes this guide; guide + paper makes the recipe book. Search a drink for recipes and quality effects. Tavern and Cookery keep independent guides. Cookery tables support bottles, cups and shakers."], "first_brew": ["1. 普通藤蔓＋甜莓→葡萄藤；三個葡萄藤豎列→8個藤架。\n2. 在泥土上的藤架種藤，延伸架子，等待下方結果；剪刀採收成熟葡萄。\n3. 對壓榨桶使用水果，再站入桶內跳踩；8顆水果榨成1000mB，以原版空桶取汁。\n4. 酒桶需要3×3×3空間，先灌入4桶相同液體，再加入配方原料。各種原料數量必須相同；空手點擊可取回一槽。\n5. 潛行空手點擊關蓋，保持區塊載入即可釀酒。\n6. 在相鄰酒嘴上使用酒館空瓶取酒。Q1即可飲用，等待可提升品質至Q6。", "Craft a vine with sweet berries for a grapevine; three vertically make eight trellises. Plant over dirt, extend frames and shear ripe fruit. Add fruit to a pressing tub, then jump inside: eight fruit yield 1000 mB. Extract with a vanilla bucket. A barrel needs a clear 3x3x3 space and four matching buckets. Add recipe ingredients in equal stack counts; empty hand retrieves a slot. Sneak with an empty hand to close. Keep the chunk loaded, then use a Tavern bottle on an adjacent tap. Q1 is drinkable; waiting improves quality up to Q6."], "quality": ["品質1即可飲用，也可能帶負面效果。區塊載入時酒桶持續熟成，最高品質6；離線不補算。\n無原料配方產16瓶；有原料配方的各槽必須同數量，最多16瓶。多種材料數量不同會拒絕關蓋，原料全部保留，可空手取回重放。配方不符會釀成醋。\nQ4以上基酒可用於調酒。部分Java專屬效果尚未移植，請查看酒效頁的標記。", "Q1 can be drunk and may have negative effects. Barrels mature in loaded chunks up to Q6 without offline progress. Ingredient-free recipes yield sixteen bottles; ingredient slots must have equal counts, up to sixteen. Unequal counts prevent closing and preserve every ingredient. Unmatched recipes produce vinegar. Q4+ base wines can be mixed. Some Java-specific effects remain unavailable; see drink effect pages."], "limitations": ["本版提供葡萄種植、榨汁、釀酒、手持／桌面調酒、酒瓶與酒杯展示、16色可乘坐吧檯椅、17種彩燈。\n尚未移植：部分Java專屬酒效、野生葡萄世界生成、氣候加速、水浸藤架、任意黑板文字、酒嘴下方自動接酒與燃燒瓶。\n葡萄可由藤蔓＋甜莓起步。支撐物被拆除時展示品會暫留原位，可手動取回。", "Available: cultivation, pressing, brewing, held/table mixing, bottle and cup displays, sixteen rideable stool colors and seventeen string lights. Remaining omissions include some Java-specific effects, wild grape generation, climate acceleration, waterlogged frames, custom blackboard text, automatic tap collection and Molotovs. Craft vines with sweet berries to start. Displays remain recoverable if their support is removed."]};
